GIVEN `the applicant is not represented by counsel` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the matters the affidavit made by the applicant states` IS A LIST OF `o 24A r 2(4)(b) matter stated by the applicant`
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`o 24A r 2(4)(b) the applicant's affidavit states all the matters required` MEANS
    BRANCH
        IF (NOT `the applicant is not represented by counsel`) THEN JUST FALSE -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words, ruling of 2026-11-05 (b)): "where the applicant is not represented by counsel"
        IF all (GIVEN m YIELD elem m `the matters the affidavit made by the applicant states`) `o 24A r 2(4)(b) all the matters` THEN JUST TRUE
        OTHERWISE NOTHING -- NOTHING-kind (silent): the paragraph says the affidavit must state "all of the following" and does not say what follows if one is missing

`o 24A r 2(4)(b) all the matters` MEANS
    LIST
        `o 24A r 2(4)(b)(i) the material that will be relied on in the PACC application`,
        `o 24A r 2(4)(b)(ii) the date the applicant first obtained the material`,
        `o 24A r 2(4)(b)(iii) why the material could not have been adduced before the relevant date with reasonable diligence`,
        `o 24A r 2(4)(b)(iv) the reason for the interval between that date and the filing of the application for PACC permission`,
        `o 24A r 2(4)(b)(v)(A) the details of every application for review permission and every review application`,
        `o 24A r 2(4)(b)(v)(B) the details of every other application for PACC permission and every PACC application`,
        `o 24A r 2(4)(b)(vi)(A) the details of every other application made on or after 28 June 2024 found to be an abuse of process`,
        `o 24A r 2(4)(b)(vi)(B) the details of every action filed on or after 28 June 2024 found to be an abuse of process`,
        `o 24A r 2(4)(b)(vii) whether the applicant is or was assisted by any person or organisation, and who and how`

-- src:3893 | (5) To avoid doubt, any affidavit mentioned in sub-paragraph ( a ) or ( b ) of paragraph (4) must state the information mentioned in that sub-paragraph even if that information relates to any event that took place before 28 June 2024, where applicable.
@ref O 24A r 2(5) (src:3893)
GIVEN `the information relates to an event that took place before 28 June 2024` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the affidavit states it` IS A BOOLEAN
