    THEN
        IF `the affidavit states it`
        THEN JUST TRUE
        ELSE NOTHING -- NOTHING-kind (silent): the paragraph says the affidavit "must state" the information and does not say what follows if it does not
    ELSE NOTHING -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): "even if that information relates to any event that took place before 28 June 2024, where applicable": the paragraph makes the point for those events only

-- src:3894 | (6) The applicant in an application for PACC permission must serve the application, the written submissions in support of that application, and the other documents mentioned in paragraph (4), on the respondent in that application.
