-- ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
§§ `Rule 3 -- Hearing of PACC application`
-- ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

-- src:3912 | 3. —(1) For the purposes of section 60H(1), where the Court of Appeal grants the application for PACC permission, the PACC application must be made to the Court of Appeal within 3 days after the date on which the permission is granted. (2) For the purposes of section 60H(1), a PACC application must be fixed for hearing within 21 days after the date on which the PACC application is made.
@ref O 24A r 3(1) (src:3912)
`o 24A r 3(1) three days` MEANS Period WITH
    `period length` IS 3
    `period unit` IS Days
    `period direction` IS `After the anchor`

@ref O 24A r 3(1) (src:3912)
GIVEN `the Court of Appeal grants the application for PACC permission` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the date the PACC application was made to the Court of Appeal` IS A DATE
      `o 3 r 3 the last day for doing the act` IS A DATE
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`o 24A r 3(1) the PACC application is made within 3 days after permission is granted` MEANS
    BRANCH
        IF (NOT `the Court of Appeal grants the application for PACC permission`) THEN JUST FALSE -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words, ruling of 2026-11-05 (b)): "where the Court of Appeal grants the application for PACC permission"
        IF `the date the PACC application was made to the Court of Appeal` AT MOST `o 3 r 3 the last day for doing the act` THEN JUST TRUE
        OTHERWISE JUST FALSE -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words, ruling of 2026-11-05 (a)): "within 3 days after the date on which the permission is granted"

@ref O 24A r 3(2) (src:3912)
GIVEN `the hearing date fixed for the PACC application` IS A DATE
      `o 3 r 3 the last day for doing the act` IS A DATE
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`o 24A r 3(2) the PACC application is fixed for hearing within 21 days after it is made` MEANS
    IF `the hearing date fixed for the PACC application` AT MOST `o 3 r 3 the last day for doing the act`
    THEN JUST TRUE
    ELSE JUST FALSE -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words, ruling of 2026-11-05 (a)): "within 21 days after the date on which the PACC application is made" (reading F-O24A-1: the hearing date)

